OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fmostly clear skies, leading to a
OL,7,Fchilly night with light winds. A grass
OL,8,Ffrost is possible by dawn for any
OL,9,Fprone rural spots.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FPlenty of dry and sunny
OL,12,Fweather throughout the day, with cloud
OL,13,Flikely remaining away to the north
OL,14,Funtil the late evening. Light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FVariable cloud and sunny spells
OL,18,FTuesday. Outbreaks of rain expected
OL,19,Ffor a time Wednesday. Fine and sunny
OL,20,FThursday. Warm by day, but chilly
OL,21,FWednesday and Thursday nights.
